Very nice, thanks. To compile on linux the function isHidden should be changed like

func isHidden(path, name string, info os.FileInfo) bool {
    return strings.HasPrefix(name, ".") && name != "." && name != ".."
}

and  "syscall" import should be removed too. Working perfectly on rakuos fedora

Thank You very much

